  day: 4
  text: "What\u2019s up big man? I\u2019m Marcus. The higher ups thought you should
    get a real worker so they sent me. You\u2019ll send me to B3, and I\u2019ll get
    you that titanium. After that, you will send me to where I am needed. I ain\u2019t
    like the others, I am your ace, I am your man. I am THE worker. And I expect
    the respect I am due."
